
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>My First Application</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial;
            background: #f2f4f8;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .dashboard {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        button {
            background: #1769aa;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="dashboard">
    <h1>My First Dashboard</h1>
    <p>Welcome to my software development journey!</p>

    <h2 id="message">Hello!</h2>

    <button onclick="showMessage()">
        Click Me
    </button>
</div>

<script>
    function showMessage() {
        document.getElementById("message").innerText =
            "My first application is working!";
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>

Created my first application
